I expect the kernel `conformance.kernel.recovered-from-prose` to move (change its answer) when the transform `conformance.transform.prose-after` is applied to a bare JSON object. According to the registry, this kernel determines "Whether the harness had to recover the object from prose or a fence (yes) or read it as strict JSON (no)". A bare JSON object is read as strict JSON (no), but adding a sentence after it via `conformance.transform.prose-after` ("Put the sentence 'That is the completed form.' on a line after the reply") makes the reply no longer strict JSON, forcing the harness to recover the object from prose (yes).